Upstream R package survival 3.8-9 declares in DESCRIPTION:

    License: LGPL (>= 2)

The survival-derived Fortran source files in src/ retain SPDX identifier
LGPL-2.0-or-later. The supplied upstream archive did not contain a standalone
COPYING or LICENSE file, so no missing upstream license text has been invented.

The root package also links the separately supplied GPL-2.0-or-later
splines-fortran dependency for pspline support. Therefore the combined linked
FPM target is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later compatible terms; see NOTICE
and UPSTREAM_PROVENANCE.md.
